<title>UK: Hardy Oil posts nine-month profit.</title>
<headline>Hardy Oil posts nine-month profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.0		    vs 5.8 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs 1.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.16		   vs 5.96 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   37.15		  vs 63.25</p>
<p> Operating result	 9.90		   vs 7.23</p>
<p> Provision for loss</p>
<p> on sale		    nil		    vs 8.0</p>
<p>Note - Comparative figures are for the year to March 31, 1996, following a change in the company's year end to December 31.</p>
<p>Full company name - Hardy Oil &amp; Gas Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
